WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.257
Elastic bodies, seen from outside.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.469
Push on the boundary, measure what pushes back.

3
00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:07.716
Do these data fix both moduli inside?

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.281
Special waves give a holomorphic comparison matrix, forced to be the identity.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.609
Claimed: yes, for any smooth moduli.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.227
Main theorem Lean-checked.
